        "heading": "Comparative Analysis: Recommended Best Practices vs High-Risk Relationship Pitfalls",
        "content": "\n          <p>Examine the operational contrasts between mature, considerate campus behaviors and common student mistakes regarding dating the sug president: the realities of public campus romance:</p>\n          <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n            <table class=\"data-table\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>Evaluation Dimension</th>\n                  <th>Recommended Best Practice</th>\n                  <th>Common High-Risk Pitfall</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Public Scrutiny</strong></td>\n                  <td>Maintains dignified composure and private personal boundaries.</td>\n                  <td>Engages in messy public arguments on campus group chats.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Campaign Demands</strong></td>\n                  <td>Offers quiet, organized support while keeping personal priorities.</td>\n                  <td>Allows election campaigns to drain tuition and study hours.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Managing Attention</strong></td>\n                  <td>Trusts partner integrity and brushes off superficial admirers.</td>\n                  <td>Becomes aggressively insecure over campaign supporters.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Academic Focus</strong></td>\n                  <td>Locks in sacred study hours and protects examination revision.</td>\n                  <td>Abandons continuous assessments to attend political rallies.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Post-Tenure Shift</strong></td>\n                  <td>Values partner character regardless of elective office or title.</td>\n                  <td>Loses interest once the political prestige and fame fade.</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n  "
