    "h1": "The \"First Lady\" / \"First Gentleman\" Pressure in Campus Politics",
    "lede": "Navigating the \"first lady\" / \"first gentleman\" pressure in campus politics requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
    "date": "2026-09-30",
