    "lede": "Navigating canteen etiquette: who pays for the extra meat on a campus date? requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
    "date": "2026-09-30",
    "ctaHeading": "Meet Verified Students on Your Campus",
    "ctaText": "Connect with ambitious, verified students across all faculties, halls of residence, and tertiary institutions on The College Date.",
