    "h1": "Cooking Competitions Between Lodges: Turning Dinners into Fun",
    "lede": "Navigating cooking competitions between lodges: turning dinners into fun requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
    "date": "2026-09-30",
    "ctaHeading": "Meet Verified Students on Your Campus",
    "ctaText": "Connect with ambitious, verified students across all faculties, halls of residence, and tertiary institutions on The College Date.",
