    "h1": "Location Sharing Between Campus Couples: Reassurance vs Surveillance",
    "lede": "Navigating location sharing between campus couples: reassurance vs surveillance requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
    "date": "2026-09-30",
    "ctaHeading": "Meet Verified Students on Your Campus",
